apiVersion: v2
name: common
description: |
  Shared library chart for {{projectName}}. Provides the common.* named
  templates (naming, labels, image/security/env helpers) and the generic workload
  templates (deployment/service/job/hpa) that every service subchart includes.
  All shared configuration is read from .Values.global.* so it flows identically
  into every subchart; cross-resource names derive from .Release.Name so a name
  computed in one chart matches the same name referenced from another.
type: library
version: 0.1.0
appVersion: "0.1.0"
